// [77] M5 WP4 (): target profiles + a fail-closed spec-legality gate. The stdlib profile validator
// mirrors the normative target-profile.schema.json; both real profiles (solidity + postgres) validate
// clean while 7 committed negatives hit their exact profile.* codes; every committed sample spec
// (len(specs)>=10) is legal against BOTH real profiles; a profile missing a needed feature fails closed
// with a diagnostic naming the feature, its originating primitive, and its source; advisory vs fail_closed
// fallback behaves on an optional unmet feature; and a malformed profile/spec fails closed with structured
// legality.bad_input JSON (in-process and via the check_spec_legality.py CLI), never a crash. See
// check_target_profiles.py.
//
// RUN: python3 %S/check_target_profiles.py %examples
